Ledger, Ledger, and Light is a bank in the financial district of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It opens consumer accounts and converts gems to coin. The Party holds an account there, opened with the sale of the gems taken from [[Org/Amber Call/People/Benjamin Grayson|Grayson]]'s study.
